{"sha": "7a3d306afe2ee002275bdcf9ae3c702d7e6aa6e8c98ec4035fad73f53aacb84f", "body": ["\\section*{第 \\ref{ch:b2:fourier} 章 --- 傅里叶级数}", "", "\\begin{solution}{exo:b2:fourier:1}", "奇性使 $a_n$ 全为零。对 $n \\geq 1$：", "\\[", "b_n = \\frac{2}{\\pi}\\int_0^{\\pi} \\sin nt\\,\\dd t", "= \\frac{2}{\\pi}\\cdot\\frac{1 - (-1)^n}{n}", "= \\begin{cases} \\frac{4}{\\pi n} & n \\text{ 奇数},\\\\ 0 & n", "\\text{ 偶数}. \\end{cases}", "\\]", "于是 $S(f)(t) = \\frac{4}{\\pi}\\sum_{k\\geq0} \\frac{\\sin\\bigl((2k+1)t", "\\bigr)}{2k+1}$。由狄利克雷定理，在 $t = \\frac\\pi2$ 处（连续点，", "取值 $1$）：$\\sin\\bigl((2k+1)\\frac\\pi2\\bigr) = (-1)^k$，得", "\\[", "1 = \\frac4\\pi \\sum_{k\\geq0}\\frac{(-1)^k}{2k+1}", "\\quad\\Longrightarrow\\quad", "\\sum_{k\\geq0}\\frac{(-1)^k}{2k+1} = \\frac{\\pi}{4}", "\\quad\\text{（莱布尼茨）}.", "\\]", "在跳跃点 $t = 0$ 处，级数之和为 $0 = \\frac{f(0^+) +", "f(0^-)}{2}$，与狄利克雷的规定相符（各项均为零，", "因而相容）。", "\\end{solution}", "", "\\begin{solution}{exo:b2:fourier:2}", "偶性使 $b_n$ 全为零；$a_0 = \\frac{1}{\\pi}\\int_{-\\pi}^\\pi\\abs", "t\\,\\dd t = \\pi$，对 $n \\geq 1$：", "\\[", "a_n = \\frac{2}{\\pi}\\int_0^\\pi t\\cos nt\\,\\dd t", "= \\frac{2}{\\pi}\\cdot\\frac{(-1)^n - 1}{n^2}", "= \\begin{cases} -\\frac{4}{\\pi n^2} & n \\text{ 奇数},\\\\ 0 & n", "\\text{ 偶数}, \\end{cases}", "\\]", "（一次分部积分）。于是", "\\[", "\\abs t = \\frac{\\pi}{2} - \\frac{4}{\\pi}\\sum_{k\\geq0}", "\\frac{\\cos\\bigl((2k+1)t\\bigr)}{(2k+1)^2} ,", "\\]", "级数\\emph{正规收敛}（$\\sum (2k+1)^{-2} < \\infty$）---", "正如\\cref{thm:b2:fourier:parseval}~(1) 对此连续", "分段 $C^1$ 函数所预言的。当 $t = 0$ 时：", "\\[", "0 = \\frac\\pi2 - \\frac4\\pi\\sum_{k\\geq0}\\frac{1}{(2k+1)^2}", "\\quad\\Longrightarrow\\quad", "\\sum_{k\\geq0}\\frac{1}{(2k+1)^2} = \\frac{\\pi^2}{8} .", "\\]", "将 $\\sum \\frac{1}{n^2}$ 按奇偶项拆分：$S =", "\\frac{\\pi^2}{8} + \\frac S4$，故 $S = \\frac{\\pi^2}{6}$，这又是巴塞尔问题的结果。", "\\end{solution}", "", "\\begin{solution}{exo:b2:fourier:3}", "偶性：$b_n = 0$；$a_0 = \\frac{1}{\\pi}\\int_{-\\pi}^{\\pi} t^2 =", "\\frac{2\\pi^2}{3}$；两次分部积分得 $a_n =", "\\frac{4(-1)^n}{n^2}$（$n \\geq 1$）。于是", "\\[", "t^2 = \\frac{\\pi^2}{3} + 4\\sum_{n\\geq1}", "\\frac{(-1)^n}{n^2}\\cos nt", "\\qquad (\\abs t \\leq \\pi),", "\\]", "此级数正规收敛。当 $t = 0$ 时：$0 = \\frac{\\pi^2}{3} +", "4\\sum\\frac{(-1)^n}{n^2}$，即 $\\sum_{n\\geq1}", "\\frac{(-1)^{n+1}}{n^2} = \\frac{\\pi^2}{12}$。由帕塞瓦尔等式：", "\\[", "\\frac{1}{2\\pi}\\int_{-\\pi}^{\\pi} t^4\\,\\dd t = \\frac{\\pi^4}{5}", "= \\frac{a_0^2}{4} + \\frac12\\sum_{n\\geq1} a_n^2", "= \\frac{\\pi^4}{9} + 8\\sum_{n\\geq1}\\frac{1}{n^4} ,", "\\]", "故 $\\sum \\frac{1}{n^4} = \\frac18\\bigl(\\frac{\\pi^4}{5} -", "\\frac{\\pi^4}{9}\\bigr) = \\frac{\\pi^4}{90}$。", "\\end{solution}", "", "\\begin{solution}{exo:b2:fourier:4}", "若 $f$ 还是分段 $C^1$ 函数，则由帕塞瓦尔等式（已证）得", "$\\norm f_2^2 = \\sum\\abs{c_n}^2 = 0$，连续函数 $\\abs f^2$ 的积分的严格正性", "迫使 $f = 0$。", "", "对仅为连续的 $f$，在本阶段不加证明地承认一般的帕塞瓦尔等式：", "其证明同样只需一行。（稠密性路线概要：费耶尔、魏尔斯特拉斯型", "三角逼近表明三角多项式", "在连续周期函数中是 $\\norm\\cdot_2$-稠密的；由于 $f", "\\perp$ 与所有这些函数正交，$\\norm f_2^2 = \\langle f, f - P\\rangle \\leq", "\\norm f_2\\norm{f - P}_2$ 对逼近函数 $P$ 成立，迫使 $\\norm f_2 =", "0$。）", "\\end{solution}", "", "\\begin{solution}{exo:b2:fourier:5}", "偶性：$b_n = 0$；", "\\[", "a_n = \\frac{2}{\\pi}\\int_0^\\pi \\cos(\\alpha t)\\cos(nt)\\,\\dd t", "= \\frac{2}{\\pi}\\cdot", "\\frac{(-1)^n\\,\\alpha\\sin(\\pi\\alpha)}{\\alpha^2 - n^2}", "\\]", "（先积化和差，再积分；$a_0 =", "\\frac{2\\sin(\\pi\\alpha)}{\\pi\\alpha}$）。在 $t = \\pi$ 处（", "周期延拓的一个连续点，其单侧取值", "由偶性而相同）：", "\\[", "\\cos(\\pi\\alpha)", "= \\frac{\\sin(\\pi\\alpha)}{\\pi\\alpha}", "+ \\sum_{n\\geq1} \\frac{2\\alpha\\sin(\\pi\\alpha)}{\\pi(\\alpha^2 -", "n^2)}\\,(-1)^n\\cos(n\\pi)", "= \\frac{\\sin(\\pi\\alpha)}{\\pi}\\Bigl(\\frac{1}{\\alpha} +", "\\sum_{n\\geq1}\\frac{2\\alpha}{\\alpha^2 - n^2}\\Bigr),", "\\]", "利用 $(-1)^n\\cos n\\pi = 1$。两边除以 $\\sin(\\pi\\alpha)/\\pi$", "即得余切展开式。", "\\end{solution}", "", "\\begin{solution}{exo:b2:fourier:6}", "反复使用 $c_n(f') = \\iu n\\,c_n(f)$（$k$ 次，", "在 $C^{k}$ 各段上分部积分，边界值匹配）：", "$c_n(f^{(k)}) = (\\iu n)^k c_n(f)$。分段连续函数 $f^{(k)}$ 的系数", "是有界的（事实上 $\\to 0$，由贝塞尔不等式）：", "\\[", "\\abs{c_n(f)} = \\frac{\\abs{c_n(f^{(k)})}}{\\abs n^k}", "= O\\bigl(\\abs n^{-k}\\bigr) .", "\\]", "\\end{solution}", ""]}